- A `Jws` which has been read from text is a claim, and nothing more. Its payload is reached
- only through `verify`, which checks the signature against a public key:
+ Un `Jws` que se ha leído de un texto es una afirmación, y nada más. Solo se llega a su carga
+ útil mediante `verify`, que comprueba la firma contra una clave pública:

= only through `verify`, which checks the signature against a public key:
=
